            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "(test)这里的东西…也被人拿走了吗？$UNRELEASED"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7412201",
      "subQuestName": "(test)靠近第n个封印$UNRELEASED$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741220101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741220101": {
            "id": "741220101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "结果最后这里什么都没有吗？$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741220102"
            ]
          },
          "741220102": {
            "id": "741220102",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "卡特皮拉",
            "text": "并不是，看起来是已经被人拿走了。$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741220103"
            ]
          },
          "741220103": {
            "id": "741220103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那岂不是我们的计划已经失败了？$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741220104"
            ]
          },
          "741220104": {
            "id": "741220104",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "卡特皮拉",
            "text": "「理性」的诞生需要四个象限合一。只要我们能拿到剩下的几个，我们就还有机会。$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741220105"
            ]
          },
          "741220105": {
            "id": "741220105",
            "speakerId": 16922,
            "speakerName": "安",
            "text": "既然如此，我们就快点去接下来的地方吧。$UNRELEASED"
          }
        }
      }
    },
